  "worked_solution": "We have $\\frac{3}{8}$ on the left and $\\frac{6}{8}$ on the right.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/67b42a3001bad8a95990eb58281c32e1bbde16924ac8d59cddd1082a878fc399.png)\n\nTherefore, the multiplication problem shown is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{8}\\times 2=\\frac{6}{8}.\n$$",
